 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "title1",
   "text": "This is TASTE: what Auracle has learned about your ear, from every pick.",
   "beat": "title",
   "t0": 15.486,
   "t1": 19.768,
   "words": [15.526, 15.706, 15.866, 16.806, 16.966, 17.286, 17.566, 17.806, 18.066, 18.246, 18.586, 18.926, 19.286]
  },
  {
   "id": "title2",
   "text": "Nothing here changes the model. It's the model, reporting on itself.",
   "beat": "title",
   "t0": 20.368,
   "t1": 24.721,
   "words": [20.407, 20.768, 21.028, 21.448, 21.668, 22.508, 22.708, 22.848, 23.34, 23.768, 24.068]
  },
  {
   "id": "tabs1",
   "text": "After a few dozen picks, there's more to read, across four tabs.",
   "beat": "tabs",
   "t0": 26.729,
   "t1": 30.601,
   "words": [26.769, 27.009, 27.189, 27.309, 27.629, 28.349, 28.529, 28.669, 28.829, 29.412, 29.689, 29.989]
  },
  {
   "id": "tabs2",
   "text": "The map shows where your sounds sit. Styles are the separate tastes it has found.",
   "beat": "tabs",
   "t0": 30.901,
   "t1": 35.519,
   "words": [30.94, 31.061, 31.261, 31.561, 31.781, 31.921, 32.161, 33.048, 33.481, 33.721, 33.861, 34.181, 34.601, 34.821, 34.961]
  },
  {
   "id": "tabs3",
   "text": "Directions show what pulls you. Trust shows whether to believe any of it.",
   "beat": "tabs",
   "t0": 35.819,
   "t1": 40.116,
   "words": [35.857, 36.459, 36.699, 36.899, 37.139, 37.81, 38.219, 38.639, 38.859, 39.059, 39.359, 39.659, 39.819]
  },
  {
   "id": "tabs4",
   "text": "The chips along the top are your styles, the same in every tab.",
   "beat": "tabs",
   "t0": 40.416,
   "t1": 44.121,
   "words": [40.456, 40.596, 40.816, 41.116, 41.296, 41.516, 41.736, 41.856, 42.776, 42.856, 43.076, 43.256, 43.556]
  },
  {
   "id": "map1",
   "text": "The map places every patch you've heard by how it sounds and how it's built.",
   "beat": "map",
   "t0": 46.014,
   "t1": 50.169,
   "words": [46.055, 46.154, 46.394, 46.794, 47.174, 47.454, 47.714, 47.854, 48.094, 48.294, 48.434, 49.137, 49.314, 49.514, 49.754]
  },
  {
   "id": "map2",
   "text": "Nearby dots tend to sound alike. It's a flat picture of many measurements, so treat distance as a hint.",
   "beat": "map",
   "t0": 50.469,
   "t1": 57.109,
   "words": [50.508, 50.989, 51.369, 51.649, 51.889, 52.129, 53.129, 53.249, 53.369, 53.609, 53.909, 54.209, 54.409, 55.249, 55.489, 55.809, 56.417, 56.589, 56.729]
  },
  {
   "id": "map3",
   "text": "Glow is how much it thinks you'll like a sound. The bank beside it is sorted by the same guess.",
   "beat": "map",
   "t0": 57.509,
   "t1": 63.252,
   "words": [57.547, 57.988, 58.149, 58.349, 58.529, 58.709, 58.969, 59.249, 59.389, 59.569, 60.509, 60.609, 60.849, 61.269, 61.529, 61.669, 61.989, 62.289, 62.449, 62.709]
  },
  {
   "id": "map4",
   "text": "Size is how unsure it is. So a small, bright dot is a firm yes.",
   "beat": "map",
   "t0": 63.652,
   "t1": 68.157,
   "words": [63.691, 63.992, 64.212, 64.392, 64.752, 64.912, 65.624, 65.792, 65.932, 66.572, 66.732, 67.072, 67.292, 67.432, 67.612]
  },
  {
   "id": "map5",
   "text": "A big, bright dot is a maybe. It could be great, and it doesn't know yet.",
   "beat": "map",
   "t0": 68.757,
   "t1": 73.244,
   "words": [68.797, 68.997, 69.357, 69.697, 69.997, 70.197, 70.317, 71.237, 71.357, 71.457, 71.597, 72.217, 72.277, 72.377, 72.617, 72.757]
  },
  {
   "id": "hear1",
   "text": "Click a dot, and that sound is under your fingers.",
   "beat": "hear",
   "t0": 74.486,
   "t1": 77.071,
   "words": [74.528, 74.686, 74.846, 75.406, 75.506, 75.706, 76.006, 76.166, 76.326, 76.486]
  },
  {
   "id": "hear2",
   "text": "The maybes are where to explore.",
   "beat": "hear",
   "t0": 81.871,
   "t1": 83.728,
   "words": [81.91, 82.011, 82.491, 82.691, 82.851, 83.011]
  },
  {
   "id": "hear3",
   "text": "And a dim dot is a sound it thinks you'd skip.",
   "beat": "hear",
   "t0": 88.528,
   "t1": 91.146,
   "words": [88.552, 88.728, 88.848, 89.048, 89.543, 89.668, 89.848, 90.068, 90.228, 90.428, 90.688]
  },
  {
   "id": "styles1",
   "text": "Your taste doesn't have to be one thing.",
   "beat": "styles",
   "t0": 96.014,
   "t1": 98.147,
   "words": [96.053, 96.194, 96.594, 97.034, 97.214, 97.354, 97.494, 97.674]
  },
  {
   "id": "styles2",
   "text": "You might love dark drones and bright plucks. One direction would average them into neither.",
   "beat": "styles",
   "t0": 98.447,
   "t1": 103.662,
   "words": [98.486, 98.607, 98.767, 99.087, 99.407, 100.034, 100.227, 100.447, 101.327, 101.607, 102.007, 102.287, 102.647, 102.927, 103.187]
  },
  {
   "id": "styles3",
   "text": "So it keeps separate styles, and a sound only has to please one.",
   "beat": "styles",
   "t0": 103.962,
   "t1": 107.794,
   "words": [104.002, 104.162, 104.282, 104.482, 104.842, 105.742, 105.902, 106.002, 106.342, 106.622, 106.902, 107.082, 107.302]
  },
  {
   "id": "styles4",
   "text": "Each chip plays its style's best example.",
   "beat": "styles",
   "t0": 108.194,
   "t1": 110.517,
   "words": [108.233, 108.454, 108.694, 108.954, 109.194, 109.654, 109.794]
  },
  {
   "id": "styles5",
   "text": "Name a style for what you hear. The name sticks, everywhere it appears.",
   "beat": "styles",
   "t0": 116.317,
   "t1": 120.317,
   "words": [116.356, 116.577, 116.737, 116.997, 117.197, 117.337, 117.477, 118.237, 118.337, 118.557, 119.177, 119.457, 119.717]
  },
  {
   "id": "dir1",
   "text": "Directions shows what each style listens for, in words for what you hear.",
   "beat": "directions",
   "t0": 123.157,
   "t1": 127.377,
   "words": [123.195, 123.807, 124.077, 124.377, 124.577, 124.937, 125.237, 126.077, 126.217, 126.437, 126.697, 126.817, 126.957]
  },
  {
   "id": "dir2",
   "text": "A bar to the right pulls you toward more of that. To the left, away.",
   "beat": "directions",
   "t0": 127.677,
   "t1": 131.375,
   "words": [127.718, 127.837, 128.017, 128.177, 128.277, 128.477, 128.737, 128.917, 129.077, 129.337, 129.477, 130.197, 130.297, 130.437, 130.717]
  },
  {
   "id": "dir3",
   "text": "Here, every style pulls away from grit.",
   "beat": "directions",
   "t0": 131.775,
   "t1": 134.227,
   "words": [131.814, 132.395, 132.615, 132.955, 133.235, 133.515, 133.755]
  },
  {
   "id": "dir4",
   "text": "Some rows share names with PERFORM's controls, like body, grit and space. They're the same measurements.",
   "beat": "directions",
   "t0": 134.727,
   "t1": 140.94,
   "words": [134.767, 135.027, 135.287, 135.627, 135.887, 136.147, 136.507, 137.507, 137.647, 138.234, 138.627, 138.647, 139.727, 139.827, 139.947, 140.207]
  },
  {
   "id": "dir5",
   "text": "Read the whisker, not the bar. If a whisker crosses the centre line, it's still a guess.",
   "beat": "directions",
   "t0": 141.44,
   "t1": 146.73,
   "words": [141.479, 141.76, 141.94, 142.6, 142.7, 142.86, 143.7, 143.84, 143.96, 144.32, 144.749, 144.88, 145.225, 145.78, 145.98, 146.12, 146.26]
  },
  {
   "id": "trust1",
   "text": "So should you believe it?",
   "beat": "trust",
   "t0": 148.157,
   "t1": 149.51,
   "words": [148.196, 148.377, 148.557, 148.717, 149.017]
  },
  {
   "id": "trust2",
   "text": "Before every duel, it forecasts your answer. Then you pick, and it keeps score.",
   "beat": "trust",
   "t0": 149.81,
   "t1": 154.46,
   "words": [149.849, 150.19, 150.55, 150.75, 151.03, 151.517, 151.67, 152.51, 152.71, 152.85, 153.405, 153.55, 153.67, 153.87]
  },
  {
   "id": "trust3",
   "text": "On the diagonal, its confidence is honest. The whiskers show how little each dot stands on.",
   "beat": "trust",
   "t0": 154.86,
   "t1": 160.72,
   "words": [154.9, 155.02, 155.12, 156.0, 156.1, 156.719, 156.88, 157.98, 158.04, 158.46, 158.74, 159.02, 159.2, 159.54, 159.84, 160.2]
  },
  {
   "id": "trust4",
   "text": "The number to trust is its score on duels dealt at random. Here, twenty percent sharper than chance.",
